Z||000006||walsh2001||04-17-2001||11:50 AM||||It sounds to me like the starter solenoid is not engaging the flywheel. The sound you hear is probably the engaging gear pinging off the side of the flywheel (They are not meshing). Have you tried putting the car and gear and rocking it back and forth?||||reg||1
